Z||000009||DavidHenshaw||12-22-2000||11:41 AM||||My favorite is Its A Wonderful Life with Jimmy Stewart. I love the scene where the evil banker steals the several thousand dollar deposit which has been entrusted to Jimmy by the towns folk. Everybody thinks Jimmy stole the money and his life just goes to hell. If you're one of the three people left in America who havn't seen this movie be sure to rent it. <P>My second favorite Christmas movie is The Iron Cross staring James Coburn who plays a German soldier who with his comrads is chased across the Russian frontier by the advancing Russian army. Ok, its not a real Christmas movie but I like it anyway.<P>Dave<P>86 GT   ||||reg||1
